<tt xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml" xmlns:itunes="http://music.apple.com/lyric-ttml-internal" xmlns:ttm="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#metadata" xmlns:tts="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#styling" xmlns:amll="http://www.example.com/ns/amll"><head><metadata><ttm:agent type="person" xml:id="v1"/><amll:meta key="musicName" value="Chase the Light"/><amll:meta key="artists" value="ADÀI宋黛霆"/><amll:meta key="artists" value="Adai Song"/><amll:meta key="artists" value="David Lin"/><amll:meta key="artists" value="Erik Castro"/><amll:meta key="artists" value="Monster Siren Records"/><amll:meta key="artists" value="塞壬唱片-MSR"/><amll:meta key="artists" value="宋黛霆"/><amll:meta key="album" value="Chase the Light"/><amll:meta key="album" value="Chase the Light - Single"/><amll:meta key="isrc" value="TWU712402115"/><amll:meta key="ncmMusicId" value="2163262921"/><amll:meta key="qqMusicId" value="004JwTFm2FvxkU"/><amll:meta key="qqMusicId" value="493626367"/><amll:meta key="spotifyId" value="0dzxPbN0ntBlh6EEzrO2qL"/><amll:meta key="appleMusicId" value="1751623962"/><amll:meta key="ttmlAuthorGithub" value="174598250"/><amll:meta key="ttmlAuthorGithubLogin" value="ASyunagi"/></metadata></head><body dur="3:42.900"><div begin="25.540" end="3:42.900"><p begin="25.540" end="28.920" itunes:key="L1" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="25.540" end="25.840">轻</span><span begin="25.840" end="26.250">舟</span><span begin="26.250" end="26.590">已</span><span begin="26.590" end="26.840">过</span><span begin="26.840" end="27.280">缠</span><span begin="27.280" end="27.630">绕</span><span begin="27.630" end="27.800">的</span><span begin="27.880" end="28.290">群</span><span begin="28.390" end="28.920">山</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">輕舟已過纏繞的群山</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">The lonely boat has passed the winding mountains</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ja">小舟はすでに連なる山々を越え</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">가벼운 배는 얽혀있던 첩첩산중을 지났고</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Le léger esquif a déjà franchi les montagnes entrelacées</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">La barca ligera ya pasó las montañas entrelazadas</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Das leichte Boot hat die umschlingenden Berge bereits hinter sich gelassen</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">O barco leve já passou pelas montanhas entrelaçadas</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Легкая лодка уже миновала гряду извилистых гор</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">La barca leggera ha già superato le montagne aggrovigliate</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">qing zhou yi guo chan rao de qun shan</span></p><p begin="29.700" end="32.960" itunes:key="L2" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="29.700" end="29.990">转</span><span begin="29.990" end="30.390">个</span><span begin="30.390" end="30.700">弯</span><span begin="30.700" end="30.960">下</span><span begin="31.060" end="31.280">个</span><span begin="31.280" end="31.440">天</span><span begin="31.440" end="31.680">地</span><span begin="31.760" end="32.040">色</span><span begin="32.040" end="32.350">彩</span><span begin="32.440" end="32.640">斑</span><span begin="32.640" end="32.960">斓</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">轉個彎下個天地色彩斑斕</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">Turning a corner the next world is a kaleidoscope of colors</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ja">角を曲がれば次の世界は色鮮やかだ</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">모퉁이를 돌면 나타날 세상은 오색찬란해</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Au prochain tournant le nouveau monde sera haut en couleur</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Al dar la vuelta el próximo mundo será colorido</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Nach der Kurve ist die nächste Welt farbenfroh</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Virando a esquina o próximo mundo é cheio de cores</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">За поворотом следующий мир сверкает всеми цветами</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Dietro l&apos;angolo il prossimo mondo è un&apos;esplosione di colori</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">zhuan ge wan xia ge tian di se cai ban lan</span></p><p begin="33.600" end="36.640" itunes:key="L3" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="33.600" end="34.360">哦</span> <span begin="34.910" end="35.030">风</span><span begin="35.030" end="35.170">在</span><span begin="35.170" end="35.400">吟</span><span begin="35.400" end="35.590">唱</span><span begin="35.590" end="35.850">着</span><span begin="35.850" end="36.160">夏</span><span begin="36.160" end="36.640">天</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">哦 風在吟唱著夏天</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">Oh the wind is singing of summer</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ja">ああ 風が夏を口ずさみ</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">오 바람은 여름을 노래하고</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Oh le vent chante l&apos;été</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Oh el viento está cantando al verano</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Oh der Wind besingt den Sommer</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Oh o vento está cantando sobre o verão</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">О ветер поет о лете</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Oh il vento canta l&apos;estate</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">o feng zai yin chang zhe xia tian</span></p><p begin="36.960" end="38.530" itunes:key="L4" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="36.960" end="37.240">我</span><span begin="37.240" end="37.720">哼</span><span begin="37.720" end="37.910">着</span><span begin="38.000" end="38.530">歌</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">我哼著歌</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">I am humming a song</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ja">私は鼻歌を歌い</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">나는 콧노래를 부르며</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Je chantonne</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Yo tarareo una canción</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Ich summe ein Lied</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Eu cantarolo uma canção</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Я напеваю песню</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Canticchio una canzone</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">wo heng zhe ge</span></p><p begin="38.990" end="40.870" itunes:key="L5" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="38.990" end="39.270">看</span><span begin="39.270" end="39.650">世</span><span begin="39.770" end="40.000">界</span><span begin="40.080" end="40.340">无</span><span begin="40.570" end="40.870">边</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">看世界無邊</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">Looking at the boundless world</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ja">果てしない世界を見つめる</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">끝없는 세상을 바라봐</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Regardant le monde sans limites</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Viendo el mundo infinito</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Und blicke in die grenzenlose Welt</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Olhando para o mundo sem limites</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Глядя на бескрайний мир</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Guardo il mondo sconfinato</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">kan shi jie wu bian</span></p><p begin="42.080" end="45.350" itunes:key="L6" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="42.080" end="42.370">星</span><span begin="42.370" end="42.690">河</span><span begin="42.790" end="43.150">畔</span><span begin="43.150" end="43.480">旧</span><span begin="43.480" end="43.760">梦</span><span begin="43.760" end="44.170">旋</span><span begin="44.170" end="44.440">转</span><span begin="44.440" end="44.820">消</span><span begin="44.930" end="45.350">散</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">星河畔舊夢旋轉消散</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">By the galaxy old dreams spin and dissipate</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ja">銀河の畔で古い夢が回り消えゆく</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">은하수 곁에서 낡은 꿈은 맴돌다 흩어지고</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Au bord de la voie lactée les vieux rêves tourbillonnent et se dissipent</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Junto al río de estrellas los viejos sueños giran y se disipan</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Am Sternenfluss wirbeln alte Träume und verblassen</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">À beira da galáxia os velhos sonhos giram e se dissipam</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">У звездной реки старые мечты кружатся и тают</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">In riva al fiume di stelle i vecchi sogni turbinano e svaniscono</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">xing he pan jiu meng xuan zhuan xiao san</span></p><p begin="46.310" end="49.640" itunes:key="L7" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="46.310" end="46.520">不</span><span begin="46.520" end="46.940">再</span><span begin="46.940" end="47.210">等</span><span begin="47.290" end="47.600">新</span><span begin="47.600" end="47.770">的</span><span begin="47.850" end="48.000">冒</span><span begin="48.000" end="48.320">险</span><span begin="48.320" end="48.630">就</span><span begin="48.630" end="48.870">要</span><span begin="48.950" end="49.120">展</span><span begin="49.120" end="49.640">开</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">不再等新的冒險就要展開</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">No longer waiting a new adventure is about to unfold</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ja">もう待たない 新たな冒険が始まる</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">더는 기다리지 않아 새로운 모험이 펼쳐질 테니</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Je n&apos;attends plus la nouvelle aventure est sur le point de commencer</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Ya no espero una nueva aventura está a punto de comenzar</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Ich warte nicht mehr ein neues Abenteuer beginnt sogleich</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Sem esperar mais a nova aventura está prestes a começar</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Больше не жду новое приключение вот-вот начнется</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Non aspetto più una nuova avventura sta per iniziare</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">bu zai deng xin de mao xian jiu yao zhan kai</span></p><p begin="50.150" end="53.160" itunes:key="L8" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="50.150" end="51.070">哦</span> <span begin="51.410" end="51.590">新</span><span begin="51.590" end="51.730">的</span><span begin="51.730" end="51.990">梦</span><span begin="51.990" end="52.150">里</span><span begin="52.150" end="52.350">有</span><span begin="52.440" end="52.770">什</span><span begin="52.770" end="53.160">么</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">哦 新的夢裡有什麼</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">Oh what is inside the new dream</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ja">ああ 新しい夢には何があるのだろう</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">오 새로운 꿈속엔 무엇이 있을까</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Oh que cache ce nouveau rêve ?</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Oh qué hay en el nuevo sueño</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Oh was verbirgt sich im neuen Traum</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Oh o que há no novo sonho</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">О что же там в новых мечтах</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Oh cosa c&apos;è nei nuovi sogni</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">o xin de meng li you shen me</span></p><p begin="53.530" end="55.120" itunes:key="L9" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="53.530" end="53.810">我</span><span begin="53.810" end="54.280">扬</span><span begin="54.280" end="54.450">着</span><span begin="54.610" end="55.120">帆</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">我揚著帆</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">I am hoisting the sail</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ja">私は帆を揚げ</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">나는 돛을 올리고</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Je hisse les voiles</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Yo izo la vela</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Ich setze die Segel</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Eu levanto as velas</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Я поднимаю паруса</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Spiego le vele</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">wo yang zhe fan</span></p><p begin="55.540" end="57.570" itunes:key="L10" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="55.540" end="55.790">看</span><span begin="55.870" end="56.390">未</span><span begin="56.390" end="56.580">来</span><span begin="56.670" end="56.960">无</span><span begin="57.160" end="57.570">限</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">看未來無限</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">Looking at the infinite future</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ja">無限の未来を見つめる</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">무한한 미래를 바라봐</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Regardant l&apos;avenir infini</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Viendo el futuro infinito</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Und blicke in die unendliche Zukunft</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Olhando para o futuro infinito</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Глядя в безграничное будущее</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Guardo il futuro infinito</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">kan wei lai wu xian</span></p><p begin="57.920" end="59.400" itunes:key="L11" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="57.920" end="59.400">我</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">我</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">I</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ja">私に</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">나는</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Moi</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Yo</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Ich</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Eu</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Я</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Io</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">wo</span></p><p begin="59.750" end="1:01.390" itunes:key="L12" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="59.750" end="59.890">剪</span><span begin="59.890" end="1:00.010">断</span><span begin="1:00.010" end="1:00.260">最</span><span begin="1:00.260" end="1:00.440">后</span><span begin="1:00.440" end="1:00.640">的</span><span begin="1:00.740" end="1:00.950">犹</span><span begin="1:01.040" end="1:01.390">豫</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">剪斷最後的猶豫</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">Cut off the last hesitation</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ja">最後の躊躇いを断ち切らせて</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">마지막 망설임을 끊어내</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Tranchant ma dernière hésitation</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Corto la última vacilación</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Schneide das letzte Zögern ab</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Corto a última hesitação</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Отсекаю последние сомнения</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Taglio via l&apos;ultima esitazione</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">jian duan zui hou de you yu</span></p><p begin="1:01.800" end="1:03.500" itunes:key="L13" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:01.800" end="1:02.060">听</span><span begin="1:02.060" end="1:03.500">风</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">聽風</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">Listening to the wind</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ja">風の音と</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">바람이 들려주는</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Écoutant le vent</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Escucho al viento</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Höre den Wind</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Ouço o vento</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Слушая ветер</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Ascolto il vento</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">ting feng</span></p><p begin="1:03.910" end="1:05.490" itunes:key="L14" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:03.910" end="1:03.980">呼</span><span begin="1:03.980" end="1:04.160">啸</span><span begin="1:04.160" end="1:04.400">而</span><span begin="1:04.400" end="1:04.560">来</span><span begin="1:04.560" end="1:04.860">的</span><span begin="1:04.860" end="1:05.130">勇</span><span begin="1:05.130" end="1:05.490">气</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">呼嘯而來的勇氣</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">The roaring courage that comes along</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ja">舞い込む勇気を感じて</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">거세게 밀려오는 용기를 안고</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Et le courage qui arrive en rugissant</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">El coraje que viene rugiendo</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Den heranbrausenden Mut</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">A coragem que vem uivando</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">И стремительно приходящую смелость</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Il coraggio che arriva ruggendo</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">hu xiao er lai de yong qi</span></p><p begin="1:05.910" end="1:09.330" itunes:key="L15" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:05.910" end="1:06.190">放</span><span begin="1:06.190" end="1:06.600">肆</span><span begin="1:06.600" end="1:06.890">地</span><span begin="1:06.980" end="1:07.260">奔</span><span begin="1:07.260" end="1:07.980">跑</span><span begin="1:07.980" end="1:08.300">在</span><span begin="1:08.300" end="1:08.560">云</span><span begin="1:08.560" end="1:08.730">朵</span><span begin="1:08.730" end="1:09.330">里</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">放肆地奔跑在雲朵裡</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">Running wildly inside the clouds</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ja">雲の中を思いのままに駆け抜ける</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">구름 속을 거침없이 달려가</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Courant sans retenue à travers les nuages</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Corriendo desinhibida entre las nubes</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Renne ausgelassen in den Wolken</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Correndo livremente por entre as nuvens</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Беззаботно бегу в облаках</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Correndo senza freni tra le nuvole</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">fang si de ben pao zai yun duo li</span></p><p begin="1:09.760" end="1:11.540" itunes:key="L16" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:09.760" end="1:10.060">再</span><span begin="1:10.060" end="1:10.320">也</span><span begin="1:10.320" end="1:10.660">不</span><span begin="1:10.660" end="1:10.840">会</span><span begin="1:10.840" end="1:11.090">怀</span><span begin="1:11.090" end="1:11.540">疑</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">再也不會懷疑</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">Never doubting again</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ja">もう二度と疑わない</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">두 번 다시 의심하지 않을 거야</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Je ne douterai plus jamais</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Ya nunca dudaré</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Werde niemals mehr zweifeln</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Nunca mais duvidarei</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">И больше никогда не усомнюсь</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Non dubiterò mai più</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">zai ye bu hui huai yi</span></p><p begin="1:11.860" end="1:13.820" itunes:key="L17" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:11.860" end="1:12.110">每</span><span begin="1:12.110" end="1:12.280">一</span><span begin="1:12.370" end="1:12.780">刻</span><span begin="1:12.780" end="1:12.890">的</span><span begin="1:12.890" end="1:13.040">自</span><span begin="1:13.140" end="1:13.820">己</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">每一刻的自己</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">Myself at every single moment</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ja">どの瞬間の自分のことも</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">매 순간의 내 모습을</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">De moi-même à chaque instant</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">De cada momento de mí misma</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">An mir selbst in jedem Moment</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">De mim mesma a cada momento</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Ни в одном мгновении себя</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Di me stessa in ogni momento</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">mei yi ke de zi ji</span></p><p begin="1:14.220" end="1:15.930" itunes:key="L18" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:14.220" end="1:14.480">让</span><span begin="1:14.480" end="1:15.930">我</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">讓我</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">Let me</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ja">私を</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">내가</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Laisse-moi</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Déjame</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Lass mich</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Deixe-me</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Позволь мне</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Lasciami</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">rang wo</span></p><p begin="1:16.280" end="1:17.930" itunes:key="L19" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:16.280" end="1:16.520">迎</span><span begin="1:16.520" end="1:16.760">着</span><span begin="1:16.760" end="1:16.920">闪</span><span begin="1:16.920" end="1:17.140">烁</span><span begin="1:17.240" end="1:17.530">晨</span><span begin="1:17.530" end="1:17.930">星</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">迎著閃爍晨星</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">Face the twinkling morning star</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ja">瞬く明けの明星に向かわせて</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">반짝이는 새벽별을 맞이하며</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Faire face à l&apos;étoile du matin scintillante</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Avanzar hacia la brillante estrella matutina</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Den funkelnden Morgensternen entgegen</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Encarar a estrela da manhã que brilha</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Шагнуть навстречу мерцающим утренним звездам</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Andare incontro alla stella del mattino che brilla</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">ying zhe shan shuo chen xing</span></p><p begin="1:18.320" end="1:20.050" itunes:key="L20" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:18.320" end="1:18.580">天</span><span begin="1:18.580" end="1:20.050">空</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">天空</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">The sky</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ja">空に</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">하늘에</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Le ciel</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">El cielo</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Der Himmel</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">O céu</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">В небе</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Il cielo</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">tian kong</span></p><p begin="1:20.430" end="1:22.240" itunes:key="L21" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:20.430" end="1:20.670">绽</span><span begin="1:20.670" end="1:20.910">放</span><span begin="1:20.910" end="1:21.100">渴</span><span begin="1:21.100" end="1:21.310">望</span><span begin="1:21.390" end="1:21.730">的</span><span begin="1:21.730" end="1:21.910">黎</span><span begin="1:21.990" end="1:22.240">明</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">綻放渴望的黎明</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">Blooms with the longed-for dawn</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ja">渇望した夜明けを咲かせよう</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">갈망하던 여명을 피워낼 수 있게</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Fait éclore l&apos;aube tant désirée</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Florece el amanecer anhelado</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Lässt die ersehnte Morgendämmerung erblühen</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Desabrocha o amanhecer tão desejado</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Расцветает долгожданный рассвет</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Fa sbocciare l&apos;alba tanto desiderata</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">zhan fang ke wang de li ming</span></p><p begin="1:22.990" end="1:25.990" itunes:key="L22" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:22.990" end="1:23.230">翱</span><span begin="1:23.230" end="1:23.530">翔</span><span begin="1:23.530" end="1:23.810">在</span><span begin="1:23.810" end="1:24.030">漫</span><span begin="1:24.030" end="1:24.220">长</span><span begin="1:24.220" end="1:24.410">无</span><span begin="1:24.520" end="1:24.800">边</span><span begin="1:24.800" end="1:25.040">的</span><span begin="1:25.040" end="1:25.330">自</span><span begin="1:25.330" end="1:25.600">由</span><span begin="1:25.600" end="1:25.990">里</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">翱翔在漫長無邊的自由裡</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">Soaring in the long and boundless freedom</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ja">果てしなく続く自由の中を舞い上がる</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">아득히 끝없는 자유 속을 비상하며</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">M&apos;envolant dans cette longue et infinie liberté</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Volando en la larga e ilimitada libertad</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Schwebe in der langen grenzenlosen Freiheit</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Voando alto na longa e infinita liberdade</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Паря в долгой и бескрайней свободе</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Volando in una libertà lunga e sconfinata</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">ao xiang zai man chang wu bian de zi you li</span></p><p begin="1:26.360" end="1:28.080" itunes:key="L23" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:26.360" end="1:26.610">等</span><span begin="1:26.610" end="1:26.880">到</span><span begin="1:26.880" end="1:27.240">太</span><span begin="1:27.240" end="1:27.380">阳</span><span begin="1:27.380" end="1:27.620">升</span><span begin="1:27.620" end="1:28.080">起</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">等到太陽升起</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">When the sun rises</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ja">太陽が昇る頃には</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">태양이 떠오를 때면</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Quand le soleil se lèvera</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Cuando salga el sol</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Wenn die Sonne aufgeht</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Quando o sol nascer</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Когда взойдет солнце</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Quando il sole sorgerà</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">deng dao tai yang sheng qi</span></p><p begin="1:28.430" end="1:30.400" itunes:key="L24" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:28.430" end="1:28.690">我</span><span begin="1:28.690" end="1:28.960">会</span><span begin="1:28.960" end="1:29.350">和</span><span begin="1:29.350" end="1:29.500">你</span><span begin="1:29.500" end="1:29.700">一</span><span begin="1:29.700" end="1:30.400">起</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">我會和你一起</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">I will be together with you</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ja">私は君と一緒にいるから</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">내가 너와 함께할게</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Je serai avec toi</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Estaré junto a ti</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Werde ich bei dir sein</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Eu estarei com você</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Я буду вместе с тобой</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Sarò insieme a te</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">wo hui he ni yi qi</span></p><p begin="1:31.770" end="1:35.090" itunes:key="L25" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:31.770" end="1:32.050">手</span><span begin="1:32.050" end="1:32.470">中</span><span begin="1:32.470" end="1:32.690">的</span><span begin="1:32.770" end="1:33.060">船</span><span begin="1:33.060" end="1:33.420">桨</span><span begin="1:33.420" end="1:33.820">翻</span><span begin="1:33.820" end="1:34.060">起</span><span begin="1:34.180" end="1:34.550">波</span><span begin="1:34.660" end="1:35.090">澜</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">手中的船槳翻起波瀾</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">The oars in hands stir up waves</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ja">手にしたオールが波を立て</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">손에 쥔 노는 물결을 일으키고</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Les rames dans mes mains soulèvent les vagues</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Los remos en mis manos levantan olas</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Das Ruder in meinen Händen schlägt Wellen</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Os remos nas mãos agitam as ondas</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Весла в руках поднимают волны</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">I remi nelle mie mani sollevano le onde</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">shou zhong de chuan jiang fan qi bo lan</span></p><p begin="1:35.900" end="1:39.190" itunes:key="L26" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:35.900" end="1:36.170">抬</span><span begin="1:36.170" end="1:36.470">头</span><span begin="1:36.580" end="1:36.920">看</span><span begin="1:37.010" end="1:37.220">迎</span><span begin="1:37.220" end="1:37.530">风</span><span begin="1:37.530" end="1:37.640">招</span><span begin="1:37.640" end="1:38.020">展</span><span begin="1:38.020" end="1:38.180">扬</span><span begin="1:38.260" end="1:38.630">起</span><span begin="1:38.630" end="1:38.740">的</span><span begin="1:38.820" end="1:39.190">帆</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">抬頭看迎風招展揚起的帆</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">Looking up at the sail fluttering and hoisting in the wind</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ja">顔を上げ風にはためく帆を見る</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">고개를 들어 바람에 펄럭이는 돛을 바라봐</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Je lève la tête pour voir la voile hissée flottant au vent</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Levanto la vista para ver la vela izada ondeando al viento</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Blicke auf zu den Segeln die im Wind flattern</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Levanto a cabeça para ver as velas erguidas tremulando ao vento</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Поднимаю взгляд на паруса развевающиеся на ветру</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Alzo lo sguardo e vedo le vele spiegate che sventolano al vento</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">tai tou kan ying feng zhao zhan yang qi de fan</span></p><p begin="1:39.830" end="1:42.840" itunes:key="L27" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:39.830" end="1:40.670">哦</span> <span begin="1:41.100" end="1:41.230">故</span><span begin="1:41.230" end="1:41.370">事</span><span begin="1:41.370" end="1:41.680">就</span><span begin="1:41.680" end="1:41.830">这</span><span begin="1:41.830" end="1:42.150">样</span><span begin="1:42.150" end="1:42.360">道</span><span begin="1:42.440" end="1:42.840">来</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">哦 故事就這樣道來</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">Oh the story is told just like this</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ja">ああ 物語はこうして語り継がれる</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">오 이야기는 이렇게 전해지지</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Oh l&apos;histoire se raconte ainsi</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Oh la historia se cuenta así</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Oh so wird die Geschichte erzählt</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Oh a história é contada assim</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">О так и рассказывается эта история</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Oh la storia viene raccontata così</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">o gu shi jiu zhe yang dao lai</span></p><p begin="1:43.220" end="1:44.790" itunes:key="L28" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:43.220" end="1:43.380">我</span><span begin="1:43.470" end="1:43.820">逐</span><span begin="1:43.910" end="1:44.250">着</span><span begin="1:44.250" end="1:44.790">浪</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">我逐著浪</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">I am chasing the waves</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ja">私は波を追いかけ</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">나는 파도를 쫓으며</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Je poursuis les vagues</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Yo persigo las olas</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Ich jage die Wellen</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Eu persigo as ondas</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Я гонюсь за волнами</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Inseguo le onde</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">wo zhu zhe lang</span></p><p begin="1:45.220" end="1:47.310" itunes:key="L29" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:45.220" end="1:45.450">看</span><span begin="1:45.530" end="1:45.880">梦</span><span begin="1:45.960" end="1:46.280">想</span><span begin="1:46.280" end="1:46.590">绽</span><span begin="1:46.750" end="1:47.310">开</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">看夢想綻開</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">Watching dreams bloom open</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ja">夢が咲くのを見つめる</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">꿈이 피어나는 걸 바라봐</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Regardant les rêves s&apos;épanouir</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Viendo los sueños florecer</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Und sehe wie der Traum erblüht</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Vendo os sonhos desabrocharem</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Глядя как расцветают мечты</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Guardo i sogni sbocciare</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">kan meng xiang zhan kai</span></p><p begin="1:48.330" end="1:51.710" itunes:key="L30" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:48.330" end="1:48.610">光</span><span begin="1:48.610" end="1:48.990">影</span><span begin="1:48.990" end="1:49.340">在</span><span begin="1:49.340" end="1:49.620">想</span><span begin="1:49.620" end="1:50.040">象</span><span begin="1:50.040" end="1:50.320">里</span><span begin="1:50.440" end="1:50.720">面</span><span begin="1:50.720" end="1:51.120">摇</span><span begin="1:51.240" end="1:51.710">摆</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">光影在想像裡面搖擺</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">Light and shadow sway within imagination</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ja">光と影が想像の中で揺らめき</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">빛과 그림자는 상상 속에서 일렁이고</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">La lumière et les ombres se balancent dans l&apos;imagination</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">La luz y la sombra se balancean en la imaginación</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Licht und Schatten schwingen in der Fantasie</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">A luz e a sombra balançam na imaginação</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Свет и тени танцуют в воображении</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Luci e ombre oscillano nell&apos;immaginazione</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">guang ying zai xiang xiang li mian yao bai</span></p><p begin="1:52.490" end="1:55.830" itunes:key="L31" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:52.490" end="1:52.740">眼</span><span begin="1:52.740" end="1:53.150">前</span><span begin="1:53.150" end="1:53.380">的</span><span begin="1:53.530" end="1:53.700">伙</span><span begin="1:53.780" end="1:54.010">伴</span><span begin="1:54.010" end="1:54.170">成</span><span begin="1:54.170" end="1:54.500">群</span><span begin="1:54.500" end="1:54.790">尽</span><span begin="1:54.790" end="1:55.090">情</span><span begin="1:55.190" end="1:55.370">挥</span><span begin="1:55.370" end="1:55.830">汗</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">眼前的夥伴成群盡情揮汗</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">Partners in front of my eyes gather in groups sweating to their hearts&apos; content</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ja">目の前の仲間たちと思いきり汗を流す</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">눈앞의 친구들은 다 함께 마음껏 땀 흘리고 있어</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Les amis devant moi transpirent à profusion en groupe</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Los compañeros frente a mí sudan a mares en grupos</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Freunde vor mir schwitzen in vollen Zügen</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Os amigos à frente em grupos suam à vontade</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Толпа друзей впереди самозабвенно отдает все силы</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">I compagni davanti a me in gruppo sudano a più non posso</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">yan qian de huo ban cheng qun jin qing hui han</span></p><p begin="1:56.370" end="1:59.400" itunes:key="L32" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:56.370" end="1:57.310">哦</span> <span begin="1:57.680" end="1:57.790">梦</span><span begin="1:57.790" end="1:57.920">在</span><span begin="1:57.920" end="1:58.170">清</span><span begin="1:58.170" end="1:58.350">晨</span><span begin="1:58.350" end="1:58.680">醒</span><span begin="1:58.680" end="1:58.980">过</span><span begin="1:58.980" end="1:59.400">来</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">哦 夢在清晨醒過來</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">Oh the dream wakes up in the early morning</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ja">ああ 朝に夢が目を覚ます</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">오 꿈은 이른 아침에 깨어나고</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Oh le rêve s&apos;éveille au petit matin</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Oh el sueño despierta en la mañana</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Oh der Traum erwacht am Morgen</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Oh o sonho acorda de manhã</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">О мечты просыпаются ранним утром</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Oh i sogni si svegliano al mattino</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">o meng zai qing chen xing guo lai</span></p><p begin="1:59.770" end="2:01.320" itunes:key="L33" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:59.770" end="1:59.880">我</span><span begin="2:00.020" end="2:00.380">陪</span><span begin="2:00.470" end="2:00.650">着</span><span begin="2:00.810" end="2:01.320">你</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">我陪著你</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">I am accompanying you</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ja">私は君のそばにいて</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">내가 네 곁에서</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Je t&apos;accompagne</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Yo te acompaño</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Ich begleite dich</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Eu acompanho você</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Я буду рядом с тобой</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Io ti accompagno</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">wo pei zhe ni</span></p><p begin="2:01.790" end="2:03.760" itunes:key="L34" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="2:01.790" end="2:01.900">一</span><span begin="2:02.030" end="2:02.360">起</span><span begin="2:02.490" end="2:02.840">去</span><span begin="2:02.840" end="2:03.160">未</span><span begin="2:03.360" end="2:03.760">来</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">一起去未來</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">Going to the future together</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ja">一緒に未来へ行くよ</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">미래로 함께 갈게</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Pour aller ensemble vers l&apos;avenir</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Juntos hacia el futuro</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Gemeinsam in die Zukunft</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Juntos para o futuro</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">И мы вместе пойдем в будущее</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Insieme verso il futuro</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">yi qi qu wei lai</span></p><p begin="2:03.820" end="2:05.590" itunes:key="L35" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="2:03.820" end="2:04.110">让</span><span begin="2:04.110" end="2:05.590">我</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">讓我</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">Let me</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ja">私に</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">나는</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Laisse-moi</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Déjame</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Lass mich</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Deixe-me</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Позволь мне</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Lasciami</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">rang wo</span></p><p begin="2:05.920" end="2:07.610" itunes:key="L36" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="2:05.920" end="2:06.200">剪</span><span begin="2:06.200" end="2:06.440">断</span><span begin="2:06.440" end="2:06.590">最</span><span begin="2:06.590" end="2:06.820">后</span><span begin="2:06.940" end="2:07.190">犹</span><span begin="2:07.190" end="2:07.610">豫</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">剪斷最後猶豫</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">Cut off the last hesitation</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ja">最後の躊躇いを断ち切らせて</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">마지막 망설임을 끊어내</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Trancher ma dernière hésitation</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Cortar la última vacilación</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Das letzte Zögern abschneiden</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Cortar a última hesitação</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Отсечь последние сомнения</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Tagliare l&apos;ultima esitazione</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">jian duan zui hou you yu</span></p><p begin="2:07.970" end="2:09.720" itunes:key="L37" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="2:07.970" end="2:08.260">听</span><span begin="2:08.260" end="2:09.720">风</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">聽風</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">Listening to the wind</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ja">風の音と</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">바람이 들려주는</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Écouter le vent</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Escuchar al viento</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Den Wind hören</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Ouvir o vento</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Слушая ветер</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Ascoltare il vento</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">ting feng</span></p><p begin="2:10.080" end="2:12.060" itunes:key="L38" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="2:10.080" end="2:10.300">呼</span><span begin="2:10.300" end="2:10.570">啸</span><span begin="2:10.570" end="2:10.720">而</span><span begin="2:10.720" end="2:10.960">来</span><span begin="2:11.060" end="2:11.380">的</span><span begin="2:11.380" end="2:11.630">勇</span><span begin="2:11.630" end="2:12.060">气</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">呼嘯而來的勇氣</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">The roaring courage that comes along</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ja">舞い込む勇気を感じて</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">거세게 밀려오는 용기를 안고</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Et le courage qui arrive en rugissant</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">El coraje que viene rugiendo</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Den heranbrausenden Mut</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">A coragem que vem uivando</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">И стремительно приходящую смелость</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Il coraggio che arriva ruggendo</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">hu xiao er lai de yong qi</span></p><p begin="2:12.600" end="2:15.600" itunes:key="L39" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="2:12.600" end="2:12.870">放</span><span begin="2:12.870" end="2:13.230">肆</span><span begin="2:13.230" end="2:13.480">地</span><span begin="2:13.480" end="2:13.720">奔</span><span begin="2:13.720" end="2:13.870">跑</span><span begin="2:13.870" end="2:14.210">在</span><span begin="2:14.210" end="2:14.460">那</span><span begin="2:14.460" end="2:14.740">云</span><span begin="2:14.740" end="2:14.960">朵</span><span begin="2:14.960" end="2:15.220">掌</span><span begin="2:15.220" end="2:15.600">心</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">放肆地奔跑在那雲朵掌心</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">Running wildly in the palm of those clouds</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ja">あの雲の掌の上を思いのままに駆け抜ける</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">저 구름의 손바닥 위를 거침없이 달려가</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Courir sans retenue au creux de ces nuages</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Corriendo desinhibida en la palma de esas nubes</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Ausgelassen in der Handfläche jener Wolken rennen</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Correndo livremente na palma daquelas nuvens</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Беззаботно бегу в ладонях этих облаков</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Correre senza freni nel palmo di quelle nuvole</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">fang si de ben pao zai na yun duo zhang xin</span></p><p begin="2:15.960" end="2:17.720" itunes:key="L40" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="2:15.960" end="2:16.260">再</span><span begin="2:16.260" end="2:16.540">也</span><span begin="2:16.540" end="2:16.810">不</span><span begin="2:16.900" end="2:17.060">会</span><span begin="2:17.060" end="2:17.340">怀</span><span begin="2:17.340" end="2:17.720">疑</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">再也不會懷疑</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">Never doubting again</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ja">もう二度と疑わない</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">두 번 다시 의심하지 않을 거야</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Je ne douterai plus jamais</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Ya nunca dudaré</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Werde niemals mehr zweifeln</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Nunca mais duvidarei</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">И больше никогда не усомнюсь</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Non dubiterò mai più</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">zai ye bu hui huai yi</span></p><p begin="2:18.090" end="2:20.080" itunes:key="L41" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="2:18.090" end="2:18.350">每</span><span begin="2:18.350" end="2:18.520">一</span><span begin="2:18.610" end="2:19.000">刻</span><span begin="2:19.000" end="2:19.110">的</span><span begin="2:19.110" end="2:19.270">自</span><span begin="2:19.370" end="2:20.080">己</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">每一刻的自己</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">Myself at every single moment</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ja">どの瞬間の自分のことも</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">매 순간의 내 모습을</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">De moi-même à chaque instant</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">De cada momento de mí misma</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">An mir selbst in jedem Moment</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">De mim mesma a cada momento</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Ни в одном мгновении себя</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Di me stessa in ogni momento</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">mei yi ke de zi ji</span></p><p begin="2:20.420" end="2:22.150" itunes:key="L42" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="2:20.420" end="2:20.680">让</span><span begin="2:20.680" end="2:22.150">我</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">讓我</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">Let me</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ja">私を</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">내가</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Laisse-moi</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Déjame</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Lass mich</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Deixe-me</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Позволь мне</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Lasciami</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">rang wo</span></p><p begin="2:22.470" end="2:24.160" itunes:key="L43" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="2:22.470" end="2:22.730">迎</span><span begin="2:22.730" end="2:22.980">着</span><span begin="2:22.980" end="2:23.140">闪</span><span begin="2:23.140" end="2:23.350">烁</span><span begin="2:23.470" end="2:23.760">晨</span><span begin="2:23.760" end="2:24.160">星</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">迎著閃爍晨星</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">Face the twinkling morning star</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ja">瞬く明けの明星に向かわせて</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">반짝이는 새벽별을 맞이하며</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Faire face à l&apos;étoile du matin scintillante</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Avanzar hacia la brillante estrella matutina</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Den funkelnden Morgensternen entgegen</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Encarar a estrela da manhã que brilha</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Шагнуть навстречу мерцающим утренним звездам</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Andare incontro alla stella del mattino che brilla</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">ying zhe shan shuo chen xing</span></p><p begin="2:24.530" end="2:26.200" itunes:key="L44" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="2:24.530" end="2:24.790">天</span><span begin="2:24.790" end="2:26.200">空</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">天空</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">The sky</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ja">空に</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">하늘에</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Le ciel</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">El cielo</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Der Himmel</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">O céu</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">В небе</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Il cielo</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">tian kong</span></p><p begin="2:26.610" end="2:28.560" itunes:key="L45" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="2:26.610" end="2:26.860">绽</span><span begin="2:26.860" end="2:27.070">放</span><span begin="2:27.150" end="2:27.280">渴</span><span begin="2:27.280" end="2:27.500">望</span><span begin="2:27.590" end="2:27.940">的</span><span begin="2:27.940" end="2:28.200">黎</span><span begin="2:28.200" end="2:28.560">明</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">綻放渴望的黎明</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">Blooms with the longed-for dawn</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ja">渇望した夜明けを咲かせよう</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">갈망하던 여명을 피워낼 수 있게</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Fait éclore l&apos;aube tant désirée</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Florece el amanecer anhelado</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Lässt die ersehnte Morgendämmerung erblühen</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Desabrochar o amanhecer tão desejado</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Расцветает долгожданный рассвет</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Fa sbocciare l&apos;alba tanto desiderata</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">zhan fang ke wang de li ming</span></p><p begin="2:29.190" end="2:32.080" itunes:key="L46" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="2:29.190" end="2:29.420">翱</span><span begin="2:29.420" end="2:29.710">翔</span><span begin="2:29.710" end="2:29.930">在</span><span begin="2:30.010" end="2:30.220">漫</span><span begin="2:30.220" end="2:30.440">长</span><span begin="2:30.440" end="2:30.520">无</span><span begin="2:30.740" end="2:30.920">边</span><span begin="2:31.010" end="2:31.270">的</span><span begin="2:31.270" end="2:31.560">自</span><span begin="2:31.560" end="2:31.800">由</span><span begin="2:31.800" end="2:32.080">里</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">翱翔在漫長無邊的自由裡</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">Soaring in the long and boundless freedom</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ja">果てしなく続く自由の中を舞い上がる</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">아득히 끝없는 자유 속을 비상하며</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">M&apos;envolant dans cette longue et infinie liberté</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Volando en la larga e ilimitada libertad</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Schwebe in der langen grenzenlosen Freiheit</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Voando alto na longa e infinita liberdade</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Паря в долгой и бескрайней свободе</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Volando in una libertà lunga e sconfinata</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">ao xiang zai man chang wu bian de zi you li</span></p><p begin="2:32.570" end="2:34.300" itunes:key="L47" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="2:32.570" end="2:32.840">等</span><span begin="2:32.840" end="2:33.110">到</span><span begin="2:33.110" end="2:33.440">太</span><span begin="2:33.440" end="2:33.590">阳</span><span begin="2:33.590" end="2:33.820">升</span><span begin="2:33.820" end="2:34.300">起</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">等到太陽升起</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">When the sun rises</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ja">太陽が昇る頃には</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">태양이 떠오를 때면</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Quand le soleil se lèvera</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Cuando salga el sol</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Wenn die Sonne aufgeht</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Quando o sol nascer</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Когда взойдет солнце</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Quando il sole sorgerà</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">deng dao tai yang sheng qi</span></p><p begin="2:34.650" end="2:36.720" itunes:key="L48" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="2:34.650" end="2:34.900">我</span><span begin="2:34.900" end="2:35.100">会</span><span begin="2:35.180" end="2:35.540">和</span><span begin="2:35.540" end="2:35.690">你</span><span begin="2:35.690" end="2:35.920">一</span><span begin="2:35.920" end="2:36.720">起</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">我會和你一起</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">I will be together with you</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ja">私は君と一緒にいるから</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">내가 너와 함께할게</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Je serai avec toi</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Estaré junto a ti</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Werde ich bei dir sein</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Eu estarei com você</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Я буду вместе с тобой</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Sarò insieme a te</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">wo hui he ni yi qi</span></p><p begin="2:37.960" end="2:39.380" itunes:key="L49" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="2:37.960" end="2:38.110">天</span><span begin="2:38.110" end="2:38.270">空</span><span begin="2:38.270" end="2:38.530">飞</span><span begin="2:38.530" end="2:38.790">扬</span><span begin="2:38.790" end="2:38.930">的</span><span begin="2:39.020" end="2:39.380">尘</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">天空飛揚的塵</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">The dust flying in the sky</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ja">空に舞う塵は</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">하늘에 흩날리는 먼지는</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">La poussière qui vole dans le ciel</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">El polvo volando en el cielo</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Der in der Luft wirbelnde Staub</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">A poeira voando no céu</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Пылинки летящие в небе</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">La polvere che vola nel cielo</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">tian kong fei yang de chen</span></p><p begin="2:40.060" end="2:41.320" itunes:key="L50" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="2:40.060" end="2:40.190">那</span><span begin="2:40.190" end="2:40.310">么</span><span begin="2:40.310" end="2:40.450">轻</span><span begin="2:40.530" end="2:40.780">快</span><span begin="2:40.780" end="2:41.050">潇</span><span begin="2:41.050" end="2:41.320">洒</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">那麼輕快瀟灑</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">So lighthearted and elegant</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ja">とても軽やかで自由だ</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">저토록 경쾌하고 자유로워</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Si légère et insouciante</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Tan ligero y desenfadado</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">So unbeschwert und frei</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Tão leve e despreocupada</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Такие легкие и свободные</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Così leggera e disinvolta</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">na me qing kuai xiao sa</span></p><p begin="2:42.080" end="2:43.370" itunes:key="L51" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="2:42.080" end="2:42.300">是</span><span begin="2:42.390" end="2:42.620">渺</span><span begin="2:42.620" end="2:42.920">小</span><span begin="2:42.920" end="2:43.130">的</span><span begin="2:43.210" end="2:43.370">我</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">是渺小的我</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">Is the world reflected</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ja">それはちっぽけな私が</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">작고 보잘것없는 내가</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">C&apos;est moi si petite</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Soy yo tan pequeña</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Ist das winzige Ich</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Sou eu tão pequena</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Это крошечная я</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">È il mondo riflesso</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">shi miao xiao de wo</span></p><p begin="2:43.440" end="2:45.760" itunes:key="L52" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="2:43.440" end="2:43.900">折</span><span begin="2:43.900" end="2:44.140">射</span><span begin="2:44.230" end="2:44.640">出</span><span begin="2:44.770" end="2:44.970">的</span><span begin="2:44.970" end="2:45.300">世</span><span begin="2:45.300" end="2:45.760">界</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">折射出的世界</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">By the tiny me</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ja">反射して見せる世界</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">굴절시켜 비춰낸 세상이지</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Qui reflète le monde</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Reflejando el mundo</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Das diese Welt reflektiert</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">O mundo que eu reflito</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Отражающая целый мир</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Dalla piccola me</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">zhe she chu de shi jie</span></p><p begin="2:46.260" end="2:49.670" itunes:key="L53" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="2:46.260" end="2:46.380">跟</span><span begin="2:46.380" end="2:46.520">着</span><span begin="2:46.520" end="2:46.760">清</span><span begin="2:46.760" end="2:47.040">凉</span><span begin="2:47.040" end="2:47.180">的</span><span begin="2:47.260" end="2:47.600">风</span><span begin="2:47.600" end="2:48.000">一</span><span begin="2:48.000" end="2:48.320">起</span><span begin="2:48.320" end="2:48.820">追</span><span begin="2:48.820" end="2:49.000">逐</span><span begin="2:49.090" end="2:49.350">探</span><span begin="2:49.350" end="2:49.670">险</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">跟著清涼的風一起追逐探險</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">Following the cool wind to chase and adventure together</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ja">涼やかな風と共に探検を追いかけ</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">시원한 바람을 따라 함께 쫓으며 탐험해</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Suivant la brise fraîche pour chasser l&apos;aventure ensemble</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Siguiendo al viento fresco juntos para perseguir la aventura</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Folge dem kühlen Wind um Abenteuer zu jagen</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Seguindo a brisa fresca para perseguir a aventura</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Вместе с прохладным ветром гонюсь за приключениями</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Inseguendo ed esplorando insieme al vento fresco</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">gen zhe qing liang de feng yi qi zhui zhu tan xian</span></p><p begin="2:50.450" end="2:53.630" itunes:key="L54" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="2:50.450" end="2:50.610">每</span><span begin="2:50.710" end="2:51.130">个</span><span begin="2:51.130" end="2:51.480">角</span><span begin="2:51.480" end="2:51.880">落</span><span begin="2:51.960" end="2:52.220">都</span><span begin="2:52.220" end="2:52.500">等</span><span begin="2:52.500" end="2:52.640">我</span><span begin="2:52.720" end="2:53.230">发</span><span begin="2:53.230" end="2:53.630">现</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">每個角落都等我發現</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">Every corner is waiting for me to discover</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ja">全ての片隅が私に見つけられるのを待っている</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">모든 구석구석이 내가 발견해주길 기다리고 있어</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Chaque recoin attend que je le découvre</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Cada rincón espera a que lo descubra</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Jeder Winkel wartet darauf von mir entdeckt zu werden</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Cada canto está esperando eu descobrir</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Каждый уголок ждет пока я его открою</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Ogni angolo aspetta di essere scoperto da me</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">mei ge jiao luo dou deng wo fa xian</span></p><p begin="3:10.070" end="3:11.780" itunes:key="L55" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="3:10.070" end="3:10.360">让</span><span begin="3:10.360" end="3:11.780">我</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">讓我</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">Let me</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ja">私に</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">내가</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Laisse-moi</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Déjame</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Lass mich</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Deixe-me</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Позволь мне</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Lasciami</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">rang wo</span></p><p begin="3:12.130" end="3:13.820" itunes:key="L56" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="3:12.130" end="3:12.430">剪</span><span begin="3:12.430" end="3:12.570">断</span><span begin="3:12.650" end="3:12.810">最</span><span begin="3:12.810" end="3:13.120">后</span><span begin="3:13.120" end="3:13.410">犹</span><span begin="3:13.410" end="3:13.820">豫</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">剪斷最後猶豫</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">Cut off the last hesitation</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ja">最後の躊躇いを断ち切らせて</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">마지막 망설임을 끊어내</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Trancher ma dernière hésitation</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Cortar la última vacilación</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Das letzte Zögern abschneiden</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Cortar a última hesitação</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Отсечь последние сомнения</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Tagliare l&apos;ultima esitazione</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">jian duan zui hou you yu</span></p><p begin="3:14.170" end="3:15.890" itunes:key="L57" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="3:14.170" end="3:14.460">听</span><span begin="3:14.460" end="3:15.890">风</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">聽風</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">Listening to the wind</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ja">風の音と</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">바람이 들려주는</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Écouter le vent</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Escuchar al viento</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Den Wind hören</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Ouvir o vento</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Слушая ветер</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Ascoltare il vento</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">ting feng</span></p><p begin="3:16.310" end="3:18.280" itunes:key="L58" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="3:16.310" end="3:16.520">呼</span><span begin="3:16.520" end="3:16.800">啸</span><span begin="3:16.800" end="3:16.970">而</span><span begin="3:16.970" end="3:17.180">来</span><span begin="3:17.280" end="3:17.610">的</span><span begin="3:17.610" end="3:17.780">勇</span><span begin="3:17.860" end="3:18.280">气</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">呼嘯而來的勇氣</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">The roaring courage that comes along</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ja">舞い込む勇気を感じて</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">거세게 밀려오는 용기를 안고</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Et le courage qui arrive en rugissant</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">El coraje que viene rugiendo</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Den heranbrausenden Mut</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">A coragem que vem uivando</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">И стремительно приходящую смелость</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Il coraggio che arriva ruggendo</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">hu xiao er lai de yong qi</span></p><p begin="3:18.790" end="3:21.840" itunes:key="L59" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="3:18.790" end="3:19.070">放</span><span begin="3:19.070" end="3:19.380">肆</span><span begin="3:19.380" end="3:19.640">地</span><span begin="3:19.640" end="3:19.900">奔</span><span begin="3:19.900" end="3:20.060">跑</span><span begin="3:20.060" end="3:20.300">在</span><span begin="3:20.420" end="3:20.650">那</span><span begin="3:20.650" end="3:20.950">云</span><span begin="3:20.950" end="3:21.190">朵</span><span begin="3:21.190" end="3:21.440">掌</span><span begin="3:21.440" end="3:21.840">心</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">放肆地奔跑在那雲朵掌心</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">Running wildly in the palm of those clouds</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ja">あの雲の掌の上を思いのままに駆け抜ける</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">저 구름의 손바닥 위를 거침없이 달려가</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Courir sans retenue au creux de ces nuages</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Corriendo desinhibida en la palma de esas nubes</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Ausgelassen in der Handfläche jener Wolken rennen</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Correndo livremente na palma daquelas nuvens</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Беззаботно бегу в ладонях этих облаков</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Correre senza freni nel palmo di quelle nuvole</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">fang si de ben pao zai na yun duo zhang xin</span></p><p begin="3:22.210" end="3:23.950" itunes:key="L60" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="3:22.210" end="3:22.480">再</span><span begin="3:22.480" end="3:22.770">也</span><span begin="3:22.770" end="3:23.020">不</span><span begin="3:23.120" end="3:23.280">会</span><span begin="3:23.280" end="3:23.470">怀</span><span begin="3:23.560" end="3:23.950">疑</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">再也不會懷疑</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">Never doubting again</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ja">もう二度と疑わない</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">두 번 다시 의심하지 않을 거야</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Je ne douterai plus jamais</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Ya nunca dudaré</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Werde niemals mehr zweifeln</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Nunca mais duvidarei</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">И больше никогда не усомнюсь</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Non dubiterò mai più</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">zai ye bu hui huai yi</span></p><p begin="3:24.310" end="3:26.100" itunes:key="L61" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="3:24.310" end="3:24.570">每</span><span begin="3:24.570" end="3:24.740">一</span><span begin="3:24.850" end="3:25.200">刻</span><span begin="3:25.200" end="3:25.320">的</span><span begin="3:25.320" end="3:25.490">自</span><span begin="3:25.590" end="3:26.100">己</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">每一刻的自己</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">Myself at every single moment</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ja">どの瞬間の自分のことも</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">매 순간의 내 모습을</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">De moi-même à chaque instant</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">De cada momento de mí misma</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">An mir selbst in jedem Moment</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">De mim mesma a cada momento</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Ни в одном мгновении себя</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Di me stessa in ogni momento</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">mei yi ke de zi ji</span></p><p begin="3:26.590" end="3:28.360" itunes:key="L62" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="3:26.590" end="3:26.870">让</span><span begin="3:26.870" end="3:28.360">我</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">讓我</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">Let me</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ja">私を</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">내가</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Laisse-moi</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Déjame</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Lass mich</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Deixe-me</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Позволь мне</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Lasciami</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">rang wo</span></p><p begin="3:28.690" end="3:30.370" itunes:key="L63" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="3:28.690" end="3:28.940">迎</span><span begin="3:28.940" end="3:29.200">着</span><span begin="3:29.200" end="3:29.380">闪</span><span begin="3:29.380" end="3:29.600">烁</span><span begin="3:29.690" end="3:29.970">晨</span><span begin="3:29.970" end="3:30.370">星</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">迎著閃爍晨星</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">Face the twinkling morning star</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ja">瞬く明けの明星に向かわせて</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">반짝이는 새벽별을 맞이하며</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Faire face à l&apos;étoile du matin scintillante</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Avanzar hacia la brillante estrella matutina</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Den funkelnden Morgensternen entgegen</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Encarar a estrela da manhã que brilha</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Шагнуть навстречу мерцающим утренним звездам</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Andare incontro alla stella del mattino che brilla</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">ying zhe shan shuo chen xing</span></p><p begin="3:30.730" end="3:32.480" itunes:key="L64" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="3:30.730" end="3:31.020">天</span><span begin="3:31.020" end="3:32.480">空</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">天空</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">The sky</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ja">空に</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">하늘에</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Le ciel</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">El cielo</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Der Himmel</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">O céu</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">В небе</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Il cielo</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">tian kong</span></p><p begin="3:32.840" end="3:34.860" itunes:key="L65" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="3:32.840" end="3:33.080">绽</span><span begin="3:33.080" end="3:33.330">放</span><span begin="3:33.330" end="3:33.520">渴</span><span begin="3:33.520" end="3:33.720">望</span><span begin="3:33.810" end="3:34.140">的</span><span begin="3:34.140" end="3:34.310">黎</span><span begin="3:34.410" end="3:34.860">明</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">綻放渴望的黎明</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">Blooms with the longed-for dawn</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ja">渇望した夜明けを咲かせよう</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">갈망하던 여명을 피워낼 수 있게</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Fait éclore l&apos;aube tant désirée</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Florece el amanecer anhelado</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Lässt die ersehnte Morgendämmerung erblühen</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Desabrochar o amanhecer tão desejado</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Расцветает долгожданный рассвет</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Fa sbocciare l&apos;alba tanto desiderata</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">zhan fang ke wang de li ming</span></p><p begin="3:35.400" end="3:38.480" itunes:key="L66" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="3:35.400" end="3:35.660">翱</span><span begin="3:35.660" end="3:35.940">翔</span><span begin="3:35.940" end="3:36.220">在</span><span begin="3:36.220" end="3:36.430">漫</span><span begin="3:36.430" end="3:36.520">长</span><span begin="3:36.610" end="3:36.720">无</span><span begin="3:36.940" end="3:37.150">边</span><span begin="3:37.230" end="3:37.470">的</span><span begin="3:37.470" end="3:37.770">自</span><span begin="3:37.770" end="3:38.040">由</span><span begin="3:38.040" end="3:38.480">里</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">翱翔在漫長無邊的自由裡</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">Soaring in the long and boundless freedom</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ja">果てしなく続く自由の中を舞い上がる</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">아득히 끝없는 자유 속을 비상하며</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">M&apos;envolant dans cette longue et infinie liberté</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Volando en la larga e ilimitada libertad</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Schwebe in der langen grenzenlosen Freiheit</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Voando alto na longa e infinita liberdade</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Паря в долгой и бескрайней свободе</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Volando in una libertà lunga e sconfinata</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">ao xiang zai man chang wu bian de zi you li</span></p><p begin="3:38.810" end="3:40.500" itunes:key="L67" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="3:38.810" end="3:39.050">等</span><span begin="3:39.050" end="3:39.310">到</span><span begin="3:39.310" end="3:39.630">太</span><span begin="3:39.630" end="3:39.770">阳</span><span begin="3:39.770" end="3:40.030">升</span><span begin="3:40.030" end="3:40.500">起</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">等到太陽升起</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">When the sun rises</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ja">太陽が昇る頃には</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">태양이 떠오를 때면</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Quand le soleil se lèvera</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Cuando salga el sol</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Wenn die Sonne aufgeht</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Quando o sol nascer</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Когда взойдет солнце</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Quando il sole sorgerà</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">deng dao tai yang sheng qi</span></p><p begin="3:40.820" end="3:42.900" itunes:key="L68" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="3:40.820" end="3:41.010">我</span><span begin="3:41.100" end="3:41.270">会</span><span begin="3:41.370" end="3:41.780">和</span><span begin="3:41.780" end="3:41.920">你</span><span begin="3:41.920" end="3:42.110">一</span><span begin="3:42.110" end="3:42.900">起</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">我會和你一起</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">I will be together with you</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ja">私は君と一緒にいるから</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">내가 너와 함께할게</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Je serai avec toi</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Estaré junto a ti</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Werde ich bei dir sein</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Eu estarei com você</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Я буду вместе с тобой</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Sarò insieme a te</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">wo hui he ni yi qi</span></p></div></body></tt>